      "caption": "What the wave examples have in common",
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "id": "s4",
      "narration": "Three things to carry away. Waves carry energy from place to place — the particles themselves just vibrate where they are. Speed, frequency and wavelength always obey v equals f times lambda. And light leaves sound far behind in any race.",
